 "summary": "BACnet objects for WaterFurnace's dual-compressor water-to-air heat pump with hot gas reheat on the FX10 controller. The BAS can command occupancy and let the FX10 hold its setpoints, or send G, Y1, Y2 and O calls directly. Space temperature and humidity can be overridden from the network, and a dehumidification setpoint and dehumidistat command drive the reheat.",
